35
00:02:34,739 --> 00:02:36,039
Sientate, Chihiro

36
00:02:56,239 --> 00:02:58,539
Cariņo, vas a matarnos!

37
00:03:00,139 --> 00:03:01,439
Un tunel?

38
00:03:15,939 --> 00:03:17,639
Que es este extraņo edificio?

39
00:03:17,739 --> 00:03:19,539
