Vete. desaparece

131
00:13:44,439 --> 00:13:45,839
Desaparece

132
00:13:53,839 --> 00:13:55,339
Puedo ver a traves!

133
00:13:58,239 --> 00:14:00,539
Es un sueņo, ha de serlo

134
00:14:53,639 --> 00:14:55,639
No temas, Soy tu amigo

135
00:14:56,139 --> 00:14:57,839
No, no. no!

136
00:14:58,339 --> 00:14:59,939
