Te buscan

149
00:16:10,139 --> 00:16:11,839
No tenemos tiempo, corre!

150
00:16:13,039 --> 00:16:15,639
No... no puedo levantarme! Oh, no!

151
00:16:16,039 --> 00:16:17,039
